#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:2347
msgid "Great, Quickemailverification authenticated successfully!!"
msgstr "Чудова, Quickemailverification успішно автентифікована !!"

#: anti-fraud-core/class-wc-af-settings.php:2362
